WEBVTT

00:01:59.288 --> 00:02:02.204
You invest your time, your
money or your identity

00:02:02.204 --> 00:02:05.829
and decisions long after it's become
obvious that they're dead ends.

00:02:07.121 --> 00:02:09.038
You may not have ended
up at fire festival,

00:02:09.371 --> 00:02:12.246
but I'm willing to bet that you've
escalated your commitment to plenty of

00:02:12.246 --> 00:02:15.704
bad decisions. So how do you
pull the plug sooner?

00:02:19.871 --> 00:02:23.871
I'm Adam Grant and this is WorkLife, my
podcast with the TED Audio Collective.

00:02:24.454 --> 00:02:28.579
I'm an organizational psychologist. I
study how to make work, not suck.

00:02:29.413 --> 00:02:30.996
In this show. I take you inside